 z pewno\u015bci\u0105 zachwyci widz\u00f3w<\/span>","oryginal_title":"Tadeo Jones y la l\u00e1mpara maravillosa","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"animacja; familijny","director":"Enrique Gato","organizer":"Anangu Grup; Ikiru Films; Lightbox Animation Studios; Telecinco Cinema","country":"Hiszpania","year":"2026","category":"Seans kinowy","categoryId":1,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":94,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789976867.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":14,"name":"ul. Soko\u0142a 8","institution_name":"Kino JDK \"Syrena\"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Jas\u0142o","city_id":1078,"zip":"38-200","addresse":"ul. Soko\u0142a 8"}},"7590":{"id":7590,"title":"Lalka ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/lalka-2026-10-02-18-00-9-3","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788340823.jpg","date":"2026-10-10T17:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":187,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-10 16:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-02 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-10 17:00:00"},"products":[{"id":76,"name":"Bilet 2D","rawPrice":2100,"price":"21,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":187}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":1632,"name":"Lalka ","description":"<span itemprop=\"description\">Warszawa ko\u0144ca XIX wieku. Serce Stanis\u0142awa Wokulskiego&nbsp;ow\u0142adni\u0119te jest szalon\u0105 mi\u0142o\u015bci\u0105 do Izabeli \u0141\u0119ckiej.\r\n On, dzi\u0119ki fortunie zdobytej na wojnie, powraca do kraju i postanawia \r\nwkroczy\u0107 do \u015bwiata wy\u017cszych sfer, aby zdoby\u0107 r\u0119k\u0119 ukochanej. Ona jest \r\nol\u015bniewaj\u0105ca i wynios\u0142a, lecz mimo arystokratycznego pochodzenia zmaga \r\nsi\u0119 z widmem finansowej ruiny. U boku Wokulskiego stoi jego wierny \r\nprzyjaciel \u2013 Ignacy Rzecki,\r\n romantyk, kt\u00f3ry z nostalgi\u0105 obserwuje, jak \u015bwiat idea\u0142\u00f3w ust\u0119puje \r\nmiejsca spo\u0142ecznym aspiracjom i bezwzgl\u0119dnej grze interes\u00f3w. Wokulski \r\nwkracza w labirynt arystokratycznych salon\u00f3w, gdzie ka\u017cdy gest mo\u017ce by\u0107 \r\npocz\u0105tkiem intrygi, a ka\u017cde s\u0142owo \u2013 zapowiedzi\u0105 zdrady. Staj\u0105cy na jego \r\ndrodze rywale, niespodziewane sojusze i dramatyczne wybory wystawi\u0105 na \r\npr\u00f3b\u0119 jego marzenia i wiar\u0119 w ludzi. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142osnym zauroczeniu,\r\n kt\u00f3re zmienia losy bohater\u00f3w i zaciera granice mi\u0119dzy sercem a rozumem<\/span>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"romans; dramat","director":"Maciej Kawalski ","organizer":"","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"Seans kinowy","categoryId":1,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":162,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788340823.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":14,"name":"ul. Soko\u0142a 8","institution_name":"Kino JDK \"Syrena\"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Jas\u0142o","city_id":1078,"zip":"38-200","addresse":"ul. Soko\u0142a 8"}},"7591":{"id":7591,"title":"Lalka ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/lalka-2026-10-02-18-00-9-4","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788340823.jpg","date":"2026-10-10T19:45:00+02:00","availableTickets":187,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-10 18:45:00","startAt":"2026-09-02 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-10 19:45:00"},"products":[{"id":76,"name":"Bilet 2D","rawPrice":2100,"price":"21,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":187}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":1632,"name":"Lalka ","description":"<span itemprop=\"description\">Warszawa ko\u0144ca XIX wieku. Serce Stanis\u0142awa Wokulskiego&nbsp;ow\u0142adni\u0119te jest szalon\u0105 mi\u0142o\u015bci\u0105 do Izabeli \u0141\u0119ckiej.\r\n On, dzi\u0119ki fortunie zdobytej na wojnie, powraca do kraju i postanawia \r\nw