\u0119 jego marzenia i wiar\u0119 w ludzi. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142osnym zauroczeniu,\r\n kt\u00f3re zmienia losy bohater\u00f3w i zaciera granice mi\u0119dzy sercem a rozumem<\/span>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"romans; dramat","director":"Maciej Kawalski ","organizer":"","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"Seans kinowy","categoryId":1,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":162,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788340823.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":14,"name":"ul. Soko\u0142a 8","institution_name":"Kino JDK \"Syrena\"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Jas\u0142o","city_id":1078,"zip":"38-200","addresse":"ul. Soko\u0142a 8"}},"7621":{"id":7621,"title":"Baranek Shaun i kud\u0142ata bestia (dubbing) ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/baranek-shaun-i-kudlata-bestia-dubbing-2026-10-16-16-00-2","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789977103.jpg","date":"2026-10-18T16:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":187,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-18 15:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-21 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-18 16:00:00"},"products":[{"id":76,"name":"Bilet 2D","rawPrice":2100,"price":"21,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":187}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":1639,"name":"Baranek Shaun i kud\u0142ata bestia (dubbing) ","description":"<span itemprop=\"description\">W tej przezabawnej kinowej przygodzie \r\nnajs\u0142ynniejszy baranek \u015bwiata zamienia si\u0119 w\u2026 szalonego naukowca. Co \r\nmo\u017ce p\u00f3j\u015b\u0107 nie tak?\r\nW wiecz\u00f3r Halloween na farmie Mossy Bottom ekscytacja przeradza si\u0119 w \r\nprzera\u017cenie, gdy niezdarny Farmer niszczy pole dyniowe. Shaun pr\u00f3buje \r\nnaprawi\u0107 to za pomoc\u0105 eksperyment\u00f3w naukowych, ale sytuacja wymyka si\u0119 \r\nspod kontroli, gdy w lesie pojawia si\u0119 dzika bestia...<\/span>","orygi