pa; Black Photon; Polski Instytut Sztuki Filmowej (PISF)","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"Seans kinowy","categoryId":1,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":95,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/1642\/1789978964.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":14,"name":"ul. Soko\u0142a 8","institution_name":"Kino JDK \"Syrena\"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Jas\u0142o","city_id":1078,"zip":"38-200","addresse":"ul. Soko\u0142a 8"}},"7630":{"id":7630,"title":"Supermocni (dubbing) ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/supermocni-dubbing-2026-10-23-16-00-5","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789978074.jpg","date":"2026-10-30T17:00:00+01:00","availableTickets":187,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-30 16:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-21 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-30 17:00:00"},"products":[{"id":76,"name":"Bilet 2D","rawPrice":2100,"price":"21,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":187}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":1641,"name":"Supermocni (dubbing) ","description":"<span itemprop=\"description\">Zo\u015bka jest troch\u0119 zwariowan\u0105 nastolatk\u0105, \r\nkt\u00f3ra najbardziej na \u015bwiecie kocha swoje zwierzaki. Gdy pewnego dnia, w \r\nnaukowym laboratorium jej mamy, dochodzi do ma\u0142ej demolki, a Zo\u015bka i \r\nzwierzaki stykaj\u0105 si\u0119 z tajemnicz\u0105 kosmiczn\u0105 substancj\u0105, \u017cycie ca\u0142ej \r\nrodziny staje na g\u0142owie! Dziewczynka i jej pupile zaczynaj\u0105 si\u0119 dziwnie \r\nzmienia\u0107. Ona staje si\u0119 bardziej dzika i zwinna, a futrzaki bardziej \r\nbystre i wygadane. Z jednej strony to \u015bwietna sprawa, bo wszyscy zyskuj\u0105\r\n niesamowite moce, ale z drugiej, je\u015bli tak dalej p\u00f3jdzie, Zo\u015bka ca\u0142kiem\r\n zmieni si\u0119 w zwierzaka, a zwierzaki w ludzi. Zosta\u0142 im tylko jeden \r\ndzie\u0144 na odwr\u00f3cenie tej dziwnej mutacji. Ale to nie jedyny problem. Ot\u00f3\u017c\r\n pewien \u017c\u0105dny w\u0142adzy naukowiec chce za pomoc\u0105 owej kosmicznej substancji\r\n przej\u0105\u0107 panowanie nad \u015bwiatem. Je\u015bli wpadnie ona w jego \u0142apy, na \r\nratunek b\u0119dzie za p\u00f3\u017ano. Zo\u015bka i jej zwierzaki musz\u0105 zapanowa\u0107 nad \r\nswoimi super mocami i wykorzysta\u0107 je do ratowania planety.<\/span>","oryginal_title":"Evolution","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"komedia; animacja","director":"Zayra Mu\u00f1oz Dominguez; Julio Soto Gurpide ","organizer":"The Thinklab ","country":"Hiszpania","year":"2026","category":"Seans kinowy","categoryId":1,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":94,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789978074.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":14,"name":"ul. Soko\u0142a 8","institution_name":"Kino JDK \"Syrena\"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Jas\u0142o","city_id":1078,"zip":"38-200","addresse":"ul. Soko\u0142a 8"}},"7643":{"id":7643,"title":"Jak \u017cy\u0107, \u017ceby nie zwariowa\u0107 ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/jak-zyc-zeby-nie-zwariowac-2026-10-23-18-00-10","image":"\/uploads\/event\/1642\/1789978964.jpg","date":"2026-10-30T19:00:00+01:00","availableTickets":187,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-30 18:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-21 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-30 19:00:00"},"products":[{"id":76,"name":"Bilet 2D","rawPrice":2100,"price":"21,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":187}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":1642,"name":"Jak \u017cy\u0107, \u017ceby nie zwariowa\u0107 ","description":"<span itemprop=\"description\">Bohaterk\u0105 filmu jest Anka \u2013 \r\nczterdziestoletnia matka dw\u00f3jki dzieci, kt\u00f3ra po rozwodzie stara si\u0119 \r\nodnale\u017a\u0107 siebie na nowo, balansuj\u0105c mi\u0119dzy rodzin\u0105, karier\u0105 i\u2026 scen\u0105 \r\nstand-upu.<\/span>","oryginal_title":"","addit