prawa, bo wszyscy zyskuj\u0105\r\n niesamowite moce, ale z drugiej, je\u015bli tak dalej p\u00f3jdzie, Zo\u015bka ca\u0142kiem\r\n zmieni si\u0119 w zwierzaka, a zwierzaki w ludzi. Zosta\u0142 im tylko jeden \r\ndzie\u0144 na odwr\u00f3cenie tej dziwnej mutacji. Ale to nie jedyny problem. Ot\u00f3\u017c\r\n pewien \u017c\u0105dny w\u0142adzy naukowiec chce za pomoc\u0105 owej kosmicznej substancji\r\n przej\u0105\u0107 panowanie nad \u015bwiatem. Je\u015bli wpadnie ona w jego \u0142apy, na \r\nratunek b\u0119dzie za p\u00f3\u017ano. Zo\u015bka i jej zwierzaki musz\u0105 zapanowa\u0107 nad \r\nswoimi super mocami i wykorzysta\u0107 je do ratowania planety.<\/span>","oryginal_title":"Evolution","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"komedia; animacja","director":"Zayra Mu\u00f1oz Dominguez; Julio Soto Gurpide ","organizer":"The Thinklab ","country":"Hiszpania","year":"2026","category":"Seans kinowy","categoryId":1,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":94,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789978074.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":14,"name":"ul. Soko\u0142a 8","institution_name":"Kino JDK \"Syrena\"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Jas\u0142o","city_id":1078,"zip":"38-200","addresse":"ul. Soko\u0142a 8"}},"7645":{"id":7645,"title":"Jak \u017cy\u0107, \u017ceby nie zwariowa\u0107 ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/jak-zyc-zeby-nie-zwariowac-2026-10-23-18-00-12","image":"\/uploads\/event\/1642\/1789978964.jpg","date":"2026-11-03T19:00:00+01:00","availableTickets":187,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-11-03 18:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-21 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-11-03 19:00:00"},"products":[{"id":76,"name":"Bilet 2D","rawPrice":2100,"price":"21,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":187}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":1642,"name":"Jak \u017cy\u0107, \u017ceby nie zwariowa\u0107 ","description":"<span itempr